---
title: "Send a query result or a terminal error"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Validate stored result
  s1: Error response complete
  s2: Send column metadata
  s3: Transport aborted
  s4: Send result rows
  s5: Successful result complete
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Validation fails before metadata
  s0 --> s2: Stored result is valid or rows stream lazily
  s2 --> s3: Transport fails#59; abort response
  s2 --> s4: Send column count, definitions, and metadata terminator
  s4 --> s1: Row stream returns SQL error
  s4 --> s3: Transport fails#59; abort response
  s4 --> s5: Rows finish#59; send success terminator
